        <td style="padding:0px">
          <table style="width:100%;border:0px;border-spacing:0px;border-collapse:separate;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto;"><tbody>
            <!-- <hr> -->
            <tr style="padding:0px;text-align:left">
              <td style="padding-left:2.5%;padding-right:2.5%;padding-top:2.5%;width:63%;vertical-align:middle">
                <!-- <p style="text-align:left">
                  <name>Andrea Bajcsy</name>
                  <br>
                  abajcsy [at] cmu [dot] edu 
                </p> -->

                <!-- <p style="display:inline;color:#ff0066;"> -->
                <p>I am an Assistant Professor in the <a href="https://www.ri.cmu.edu/">Robotics Institute</a> and <a href="https://www.cs.cmu.edu/">School of Computer Science</a> at <a href="https://www.cmu.edu/">Carnegie Mellon University</a>.</p>

                <p>I lead the <a href="https://cmu-intentlab.github.io/">Interactive and Trustworthy Robotics Lab (Intent Lab)</a>. My research interests lie in the intersection of robotics, machine learning, and AI safety. </p>
                
                <p>I obtained my Ph.D. in Electrical Engineering and Computer Sciences (EECS) from <a href="https://eecs.berkeley.edu/">University of California Berkeley</a> in 2022. I received a B.S. in Computer Science from the <a href="https://umd.edu/">University of Maryland College Park</a> in 2016. Before joining CMU in Sept. 2023, I was a postdoctoral scholar at UC Berkeley and spent spring 2021 working at NVIDIA in the <a href="https://nvr-avg.github.io/">Autonomous Vehicle Research Group</a>.</p> 

                <!-- <p style="color:black;">
                  <i class="fa fa-bullhorn" aria-hidden="true"></i><b> I am recruiting PhD students for Fall 2026! Please apply <a href="https://www.ri.cmu.edu/education/academic-programs/doctoral-robotics-program/how-to-apply/">here</a>.</b>
                </p>-->
                
                <p><b>Prospective students:</b> please see <a href="https://cmu-intentlab.github.io/join.html">here</a>.</p> 
                
                <p style="text-align:left">
                  <a href="mailto:abajcsy@cmu.edu"><b>email</b></a> &nbsp&nbsp|&nbsp&nbsp
                  <a href="abajcsy_cv.pdf"><b>cv</b></a> &nbsp&nbsp|&nbsp&nbsp
                  <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=LUe32ToAAAAJ&hl=en"><b>google scholar</b></a> &nbsp&nbsp|&nbsp&nbsp
                  <a href="https://github.com/abajcsy"><b>github</b></a>&nbsp&nbsp|&nbsp&nbsp
                  <a href="bio.html"><b>bio</b></a>
                </p>
              </td>
